      "en": "Elite Form. For 10...74...90 seconds, your attacks deal holy damage. Whenever you use a Dervish attack skill, you lose 1 hex. Whenever you lose a Dervish enchantment, all allies in earshot are healed for 5...41...50 Health. This skill is disabled for 45 seconds.",
